{
  "id": "rematch-arrival-order-a",
  "title": "Concurrent re-matches of one note: the colliding one arrives first",
  "covers": [
    "ticket follow-up 3: a merge triggered by an entry_seq write that later loses last-writer-wins stays merged"
  ],
  "narrative": [
    "Unmatched note X ('たべる'). Offline, A matches it to 食べる (T+10) - which W already studies - and B matches it to 持つ (T+20).",
    "A's op arrives first: it wins the entry_seq register (no clock yet), X now collides with W, the server merges X into W.",
    "B's op arrives: it is newer, so on X the register becomes 持つ. X is already merged; merges are permanent, and entry_seq is never forwarded. X stays a tombstone pointing at W.",
    "Compare rematch-arrival-order-b: same ops, other arrival order, no merge. Accepted trade-off; all replicas follow the server's log either way."
  ],
